				<r3d:remarks>The SICAS Medical Image Repository is a freely accessible repository containing medical research data including medical images, surface models, clinical data, genomics data and statistical shape models. The data can freely be organized and shared on SMIR and made publicly accessible with a DOI. Dedicated data sets are organized as collections of anatomical regions (e.g Cochlea). The data can be filtered using a modular search and accessed on the web or through the SMIR API.. SMIR contains BRATS (Brain Tumor Segmentation)2012 ff, ISLES (Ischemic Ischemic Stroke Lesion Segmentation) 2015 ff and Shape (Statistical Shape Model Challenge) 2014.</r3d:remarks>
